{"article_ids": ["c94618fdcb7ec312"], "canonical_title": "DART-ES: Difficulty-Aware Reweighting and Targeted Replay for Fine-Tuning LLMs with Evolution Strategies", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.9, "description": "The paper proposes DART-ES, a method that adds Difficulty-Aware Reweighting and Targeted Replay to Evolution Strategies (ES) used for full‑parameter fine‑tuning of large language models. These techniques replace the standard ES practice of uniformly averaging rewards across problems, allowing the algorithm to account for how the learning value of each problem varies with model capability.", "entities": ["term:dart", "term:es"], "first_seen": "2026-10-07T04:00:00Z", "id": "evt_c94618fdcb7ec312", "importance_score": 5.64, "last_updated": "2026-10-07T04:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-lg"]}
